<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1428_5103.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünttlig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpürlig</unclear> gutwillig diennst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">miet</unclear>
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erpiettung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allne</unclear> eeren liebs unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züvor</unclear> edel
<lb n="3"/>from <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eerenvest</unclear> fürsichtig unnd wyß liebe Herren
<lb n="4"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frünndt</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füreeren</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hanns Lienberger</persName>
<lb n="5"/>genamt Koch unnser burger <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnedignen</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>fürsten unnd Herren vonn <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sannt</unclear> Gallen</placeName> unnser
<lb n="7"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeiner</unclear> stadt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschworener</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weybel</unclear>. Ist <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hüt</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> vor unns erschinen, unnd miet beschwerd ann-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeygen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürbrinngen</unclear> lassen, wie das Inen Got
<lb n="10"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allmechtig</unclear> mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zimling</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vyle</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khinden</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beladnen</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorhabnns</unclear> sye die sonderlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handlwerch</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zulernen</unclear>, unnder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solchem</unclear> er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">siner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sünen</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>zu einem Mesßer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schmid</unclear> unnd burger by üch ver-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dingkt</unclear>. wie er auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstanndne</unclear>, by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woll</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>anngelassen, nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mög</unclear> er wüssen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> unnd
<lb n="16"/>sinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sone</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uyl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gündt</unclear>. Sonnder sye vor der
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zunfft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verklagt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschwezt</unclear> worden. das er
<lb n="18"/>künfftig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hanndwerchs</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Redlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sye</unclear>, nebent
<lb n="19"/>dem auch sinem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meyster</unclear> gebotten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wordenn</unclear>.
<lb n="20"/>das er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hanndtwerch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lernen</unclear> sölle, unnd
<lb n="21"/>allso <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonn</unclear> wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zugeschikht</unclear>. darab er
<lb n="22"/>nun nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hoechlings</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bedüren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">empfanngne</unclear>. In ann-
<lb n="23"/>sehung. das sömlichs gegen sinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorfarendnen</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weyblen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nie</unclear> allso gebrucht. das Ire khind miet
<lb n="25"/>sölchen unnd derglychen hanndtwerch zu lernen
<lb n="26"/>verhinndert worden, unnd domit er unnd sin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">son</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ane</unclear> Irem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürnemnen</unclear> nit verhindert werden. So
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hate</unclear> er unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnderthänig</unclear>. wir wellen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> gegen
<lb n="29"/>üch unnd einer zunfft miet einer fürschrifft. unnd
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darnebent</unclear> was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sine</unclear> ampt unnd diennst Innhallt
<lb n="31"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermäge</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bejegenen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berüsten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Welches</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear> wir Ime nit ab schlachen khännen. Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haltten</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Imen</unclear> verstand nit. wie ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zunfft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßhalb</unclear>
<lb n="34"/>by üch weyblen mächte. dann er (wie vorstadt) unser
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschworener</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grichtz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weybel</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gricht</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stadtaman</unclear> by üch) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denn</unclear> stab. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Urkhundt</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>sich Inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Brieffen</unclear>. das erannsach unnd In-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">namen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hochwürdigen</unclear>, fürsten unnd Herren,
<lb n="39"/>Herren <persName resp="#ner">Bernnhart</persName> abbte des <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-541" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Gotzhus sannt
<lb n="40"/>Gallen</orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">x</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-517" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schultheyß</unclear> unnd Rath der stadt Wyl</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1428_5104.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">offenlich</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gricht</unclear> gseßen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sije</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darnebend</unclear> so ist ime
<lb n="42"/>auch aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hare</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zoll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innzuonemen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überantwurt</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beuolhen</unclear>. Das nun unnserm <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnedigen</unclear> herren unnd
<lb n="44"/>unns, wann unnser weijbel unnd stattknecht (so Inn-
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abwesen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weijbels</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glicheu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwaelt</unclear> unnd stab füeren)
<lb n="46"/>unnd ire kinder allso <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handtwerckhe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhindert</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschwerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fallen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thete</unclear>. Dann sij nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>Inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rijchsstetten</unclear> für henger sonnder unnsers theijls
<lb n="49"/>für Eerliche Lüt unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Riuchter</unclear> geachtet unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehalten</unclear>
<lb n="50"/>werden. Derowegen uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzelter</unclear> ursach. So
<lb n="51"/>gelanngt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ann</unclear> üch unnser Nachpürlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aunsinnen</unclear> unnd
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear>. Ir wellen mit üwer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zunfft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> üch Reden unnd
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschaffen</unclear> lassen das sij unnsers <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weijbels</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonn</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">siun</unclear>
